{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國總統李在明周六重申，政府將向任何舉報本周高考作弊行為的人提供1億韓元（約合7.5萬美元）的獎勵。他將這種違規行為比作涉及政府官員的「腐敗犯罪」，性質同樣嚴重。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587372.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T09:23:54.705111+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":86,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T09:11:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:15.716184+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:15.716184+00:00","content_hash":"cbb2d37d05cb1f90c960eaf4971c9f045c2cf3599877e8131146453a7b397651","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}